    "message": "Package DataStandardizer.ISO15924 has been replaced by package DataStandardizer.Language.  Future fixes and enhancements will be incorporated into DataStandardizer.Language only.  All users of DataStandardizer.ISO15924 are encouraged to migrate to DataStandardizer.Language at their earliest convenience.",
